<section class="page-hero"><div class="shell narrow center reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Everything has a place</p><h1>A complete toolkit for your personal paper trail.</h1><p>DocManFu helps you capture, understand, organize, retrieve, and protect the documents that quietly run your life.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="shell detail-feature-grid">
{% set features = [
 {icon:'◉', title:'Searchable OCR', text:'OCRmyPDF and Tesseract turn PDFs, JPGs, PNGs, TIFFs, and WebP images into searchable text. Existing text stays intact; scanned pages become useful.'},
 {icon:'✦', title:'AI document analysis', text:'Automatically classify bills, statements, medical records, tax forms, insurance documents, and more. Generate sensible names, tags, and structured metadata.'},
 {icon:'⌕', title:'Fast full-text search', text:'Search names and extracted document content, then narrow results by type, tag, upload date, or date range. The phrase you remember is enough.'},
 {icon:'◇', title:'Tags and smart metadata', text:'Add your own color-coded tags or accept AI suggestions. Edit names and metadata at any time without changing the original file.'},
 {icon:'＄', title:'Bill tracking', text:'Keep amount, due date, paid status, and payment details beside the bill itself. Quick filters reveal what is upcoming or overdue.'},
 {icon:'↥', title:'Flexible capture', text:'Drag and drop multiple files, upload from any browser, import Evernote ENEX archives, or automate a scanner folder with the DocManFu CLI watcher.'},
 {icon:'▣', title:'Built-in PDF preview', text:'Preview documents in the browser, inspect extracted text and AI metadata, edit tags, download the original, or reprocess with updated settings.'},
 {icon:'⚙', title:'Background processing', text:'Celery and Redis process OCR, AI analysis, and imports outside the request cycle. Live job progress and status events keep the interface responsive.'},
 {icon:'⌂', title:'Self-hosted storage', text:'Files remain on storage you select. Deploy to a NAS, homelab, or VPS with Docker and standard open-source infrastructure.'},
 {icon:'◎', title:'Choose your AI', text:'Use OpenAI, Anthropic, local Ollama, or no AI at all. OCR and document management continue to work when AI is disabled.'},
 {icon:'♙', title:'Accounts and roles', text:'JWT-based authentication, admin and user roles, per-user document ownership, API keys, and first-run setup protect multi-user installations.'},
 {icon:'↺', title:'Backups and portability', text:'Standard PostgreSQL backups plus ordinary files on disk mean your archive is understandable, movable, and recoverable without a proprietary cloud export.'}
