<section class="section feature-deep"><div class="shell split-panel"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">The processing pipeline</p><h2>Every upload gets more useful.</h2><p>The original file is safely stored first. Then DocManFu creates a tracked processing job, runs OCR, extracts text, and—if enabled—asks your chosen AI provider for classification and metadata.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Original file is preserved</li><li>Retries handle temporary failures</li><li>Every job has visible status and history</li><li>Reprocess documents when settings improve</li></ul></div><div class="pipeline reveal delay-1"><div><span>1</span><b>Capture</b><small>PDF or image</small></div><i>→</i><div><span>2</span><b>OCR</b><small>Searchable text</small></div><i>→</i><div><span>3</span><b>Analyze</b><small>Name, type, tags</small></div><i>→</i><div><span>4</span><b>Find</b><small>Instant retrieval</small></div></div></div></section>
